:"宋"}},{"title":"蛙声","author":"王炎","text":"官蛙不问雨兼晴，阁阁无端聒耳鸣。\n对客自誇闻鼓吹，稚圭此语岂真情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15852,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新晴二绝 其二","author":"王炎","text":"鸲鹆喜晴鸣竹枝，一篙新浪拍渔矶。\n春寒稍向日边破，花信欲从风际归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15853,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新晴二绝 其一","author":"王炎","text":"初春欲暖未全暖，小雨妨晴还得晴。\n多谢东风旧相识，少年乐事已寒盟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15854,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"溪上晚望二绝 其二","author":"王炎","text":"日堕西山烟水昏，寂寥鸡犬数家村。\n沧洲归鹭客停棹，古寺疏钟人掩门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15855,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"溪上晚望二绝 其一","author":"王炎","text":"溪深一股渌浮浮，桥断人归拿小舟。\n烟淡云黄来暝色，青山数叠不遮愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15856,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬白云张道士惠诗","author":"王炎","text":"不但学仙仍学诗，年来古锦富珠玑。\n却疑汗漫骑鲸李，误向天台访子微。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":15857,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬俞子清侍郎惠画韵 其二","author":"王炎","text":"一去星沙二十年，梦魂时到橘洲边